msgid "=== \"Existing CANN environment\""
msgstr "=== \"已有 CANN 环境\""

msgid ""
"## 4.2 Install in an Existing CANN Environment {: #existing-cann-environment"
" }"
msgstr "## 4.2 在已有 CANN 环境中安装 {: #existing-cann-environment }"

msgid ""
"This path covers two starting points: an official CANN base image, or CANN "
"already installed on the host or in an existing container. Both approaches "
"use the same subsequent installation steps for vLLM and vLLM Ascend."
msgstr ""
"这条路径同时覆盖两种起点：使用官方 CANN 基础镜像，或者使用 Host/现有容器中\n"
"    已经安装好的 CANN。两种方式都继续安装同一套 vLLM 和 vLLM Ascend。"

msgid "### 4.2.1 Prepare the CANN Environment {: #prepare-existing-cann }"
msgstr "### 4.2.1 准备 CANN 环境 {: #prepare-existing-cann }"

msgid "=== \"CANN base image\""
msgstr "=== \"CANN 基础镜像\""

msgid ""
"Select a CANN image that matches the target hardware and the release "
"baseline on this page:"
msgstr "选择与目标硬件和本页发布基线匹配的 CANN 镜像："

msgid "| Hardware | Recommended Ubuntu CANN base image |"
msgstr "| 硬件 | 推荐的 Ubuntu CANN 基础镜像 |"

msgid ""
"        | Atlas A2 | `quay.io/ascend/cann:{{ release_cann_version "
"}}-910b-ubuntu22.04-py3.12` |"
msgstr ""
"        | Atlas A2 | `quay.io/ascend/cann:{{ release_cann_version "
"}}-910b-ubuntu22.04-py3.12` |"

msgid ""
"        | Atlas A3 | `quay.io/ascend/cann:{{ release_cann_version "
"}}-a3-ubuntu22.04-py3.12` |"
msgstr ""
"        | Atlas A3 | `quay.io/ascend/cann:{{ release_cann_version "
"}}-a3-ubuntu22.04-py3.12` |"

msgid ""
"        | Atlas 300I DUO / Atlas 200I Pro | The official archive for `{{ "
"release_cann_version }}` does not currently confirm a corresponding 310P "
"base image tag. Use a pre-built vLLM Ascend image, or manually install the "
"matching packages. |"
msgstr ""
"        | Atlas 300I DUO / Atlas 200I Pro | 当前 `{{ release_cann_version }}` "
"官方历史清单未确认对应的 310P 基础镜像标签；请使用预构建 vLLM Ascend 镜像，或手工安装匹配的软件包 |"

msgid ""
"        | Atlas 950DT | `quay.io/ascend/cann:{{ release_cann_version "
"}}-950-ubuntu22.04-py3.12` |"
msgstr ""
"        | Atlas 950DT | `quay.io/ascend/cann:{{ release_cann_version "
"}}-950-ubuntu22.04-py3.12` |"

msgid ""
"For other operating systems and available tags, refer to the\n"
"        [CANN Container Image Overview](https://github.com/Ascend/cann-container-image/blob/main/OVERVIEW.md).\n"
"        The CANN base image already includes the Toolkit, hardware operator package, and NNAL, so you do not need to reinstall CANN inside the container."
msgstr ""
"其他操作系统和可用标签以\n"
"        [CANN Container Image Overview](https://github.com/Ascend/cann-container-image/blob/main/OVERVIEW.md)\n"
"        为准。CANN 基础镜像已经包含 Toolkit、硬件算子包和 NNAL，不需要在容器内\n"
"        再安装一遍 CANN。"

msgid "The following example starts an Atlas A2 CANN base image:"
msgstr "下面以 Atlas A2 为例启动 CANN 基础镜像："

msgid ""
"Other hardware must use the corresponding device nodes and host driver "
"mounts. For exact examples, see:"
msgstr "其他硬件必须使用对应的 device node 和 Host driver mount。可精确参考："

msgid ""
"- [Atlas A2 container mappings](quick_start.md#quickstart-atlas-a2-container)\n"
"        - [Atlas A3 container mappings](quick_start.md#quickstart-atlas-a3-container)\n"
"        - [Atlas 300I DUO container mappings](quick_start.md#quickstart-atlas-300i-duo-container)\n"
"        - [Atlas 200I Pro container mappings](quick_start.md#quickstart-atlas-200i-pro-container)\n"
"        - [Atlas 950DT container mappings](quick_start.md#quickstart-atlas-950dt-container)"
msgstr ""
"- [Atlas A2 容器映射](quick_start.md#quickstart-atlas-a2-container)\n"
"        - [Atlas A3 容器映射](quick_start.md#quickstart-atlas-a3-container)\n"
"        - [Atlas 300I DUO 容器映射](quick_start.md#quickstart-atlas-300i-duo-container)\n"
"        - [Atlas 200I Pro 容器映射](quick_start.md#quickstart-atlas-200i-pro-container)\n"
"        - [Atlas 950DT 容器映射](quick_start.md#quickstart-atlas-950dt-container)"

msgid "=== \"CANN already installed\""
msgstr "=== \"已经安装 CANN\""

msgid ""
"If a compatible CANN version is already installed on the host or in an "
"existing container, load the default installation paths:"
msgstr "如果 Host 或现有容器已经安装兼容 CANN，加载默认安装路径："

msgid ""
"If CANN is installed in another location, use the corresponding "
"`set_env.sh`. Before continuing, verify that "
"`/usr/local/Ascend/nnal/atb/set_env.sh` and `libatb.so` are available. If "
"either is missing, first install the NNAL version that matches the Toolkit "
"and hardware operator package."
msgstr ""
"如果 CANN 安装在其他路径，请使用对应的 `set_env.sh`。进入下一步前，确认\n"
"        `/usr/local/Ascend/nnal/atb/set_env.sh` 和 `libatb.so` 可用；缺失时应先补装\n"
"        与 Toolkit 和硬件算子包同版本的 NNAL。"

msgid ""
"### 4.2.2 Install vLLM and vLLM Ascend {: #existing-cann-install-vllm }"
msgstr "### 4.2.2 安装 vLLM 和 vLLM Ascend {: #existing-cann-install-vllm }"

msgid "{% include \"getting_started/installation/install_vllm_ascend.inc.md\" %}"
msgstr "{% include \"getting_started/installation/install_vllm_ascend.inc.md\" %}"

msgid "### 4.2.3 Verify the Installation {: #existing-cann-verify }"
msgstr "### 4.2.3 验证安装 {: #existing-cann-verify }"

msgid "{% include \"getting_started/installation/verify_installation.inc.md\" %}"
msgstr "{% include \"getting_started/installation/verify_installation.inc.md\" %}"

msgid "### 4.2.4 Completion Criteria {: #existing-cann-complete }"
msgstr "### 4.2.4 完成标准 {: #existing-cann-complete }"

msgid ""
"This path is complete after the NPU tensor operation, vLLM Ascend plugin "
"registration, and core dependency checks all pass."
msgstr ""
"NPU tensor operation、vLLM Ascend plugin registration 和核心依赖检查\n"
"    全部通过后，本路径完成。"
